# Build artifacts. All five are written by scripts/build.mjs, which the README
# already tells you to run (`npm run build`, or `npm start`, which builds then
# serves). Committing them meant every data edit carried ~5 MB of regenerated
# output into the diff, and history had already grown several near-identical
# 3 MB copies of tree.json. Untracked 2026-10-04; still present in history
# before that commit.
public/tree.json
public/tree.meta.json
public/tree.dot
public/tree.mmd
docs/TREE.md

# Standalone C64 viewer bundle (scripts/standalone.mjs output, includes a
# copy of the tree.json build artifact above). Regenerate with
# `npm run build:standalone`; do not commit.
c64-standalone/

# Local scratch
*.log